  tokens: tokens,
  sentences: sentences,
  phrases: phrases
};
```
This code will parse the input string using regular expressions to extract tokens, split it into sentences, and then extract phrases from each sentence. The resulting object will have properties for each parsed component, such as "tokens", "sentences", and "phrases".

