1. Validating an XML document against an XSD schema:
```
function validateXML(xmlString, xsdSchema) {
  const parser = new DOMParser();
  const xmlDoc = parser.parseFromString(xmlString, "text/xml");
  const xsdDoc = parser.parseFromString(xsdSchema, "text/xml");

  // Create a Schema object from the XSD schema
  const schema = new XMLSchema();
  schema.addSchema(xsdDoc);

  // Validate the XML document against the XSD schema
  return schema.validate(xmlDoc);
}
```
