  // Decompress the data using the BZip2 class
  const decompressedData = bzip2.decompress(data);

  // Return the decompressed data
  return decompressedData;
}
```
This code creates a new instance of the `BZip2` class from the `bzip2-js` library and defines a function called `decompress` that takes a bzipped data stream as input. The function uses the `decompress` method of the `BZip2` class to decompress the data, and then returns the decompressed data.

