To prevent moment.js from loading all locales when using webpack, you can use the `exclude` option in your webpack configuration to exclude the locale files that you don't need. Here is an example of how you can modify your webpack configuration:
```
module.exports = {
  //... other config options ...
  resolve: {
    alias: {
      moment: path.join(__dirname, "src/lib/bower/moment/moment.js")
    },
    exclude: [
      'node_modules/moment/locale/*'
    ]
  }
};
```
This will exclude all locale files from being resolved by webpack, so they won't be included in your bundle.

Alternatively, you can also use the `ignore` option to ignore specific modules or packages that you don't need. Here is an example of how you can modify your webpack configuration:
```
module.exports = {
  //... other config options ...
  resolve: {
    alias: {
      moment: path.join(__dirname, "src/lib/bower/moment/moment.js")
    },
    ignore: [
      'node_modules/moment/locale/*'
    ]
  }
};
```
This will ignore all locale files from being resolved by webpack, so they won't be included in your bundle.

You can also use the `externals` option to exclude specific modules or packages that you don't need. Here is an example of how you can modify your webpack configuration:
```
module.exports = {
  //... other config options ...
  resolve: {
    alias: {
      moment: path.join(__dirname, "src/lib/bower/moment/moment.js")
    },
    externals: [
      'node_modules/moment/locale/*'
    ]
  }
};
```
This will exclude all locale files from being resolved by webpack, so they won't be included in your bundle.

It's also worth noting that you can use the `webpack-ignore` plugin to ignore specific modules or packages that you don't need. Here is an example of how you can modify your webpack configuration:
```
const WebpackIgnorePlugin = require('webpack-ignore');

module.exports = {
  //... other config options ...
  plugins: [
    new WebpackIgnorePlugin({
      patterns: ['node_modules/moment/locale/*']
    })
  ]
};
```
This will ignore all locale files from being resolved by webpack, so they won't be included in your bundle.

