```typescript
import { sveltekit } from '@sveltejs/kit/vite';
import { webSocketServer } from 'vite-plugin-websocket';

const config = {
  plugins: [sveltekit(), webSocketServer()],
};

export default config;
```
This code creates a WebSocket server using the `webSocketServer` plugin, which allows you to create a WebSocket server without having to use the `ws` package. You can then connect to this WebSocket server from your frontend using the `WebSocket` class.

