In this example, the `availableAppDefinitions` getter is marked as a dependent key of the `selectedAppCategories` property using the `@dependentKeyCompatible` decorator. This means that Ember will recompute the value of `availableAppDefinitions` whenever the value of `selectedAppCategories` changes.

