import PouchDB from 'pouchdb';
```
However, since you're using Vite, you can also use the `@vitejs/plugin-pouchdb` plugin to automatically handle the import of PouchDB. To do this, you need to install the plugin and then add it to your `vite.config.js` file:
```
npm install --save @vitejs/plugin-pouchdb
```
Then in your `vite.config.js` file, add the following code:
```
import { defineConfig } from 'vite';
import { svelte } from '@sveltejs/vite-plugin-svelte';
import PouchDB from 'pouchdb';

export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [svelte(), PouchDB()],
});
```
This will automatically import and configure PouchDB for you, so you can use it in your Svelte components without any additional setup.

